      "category": "training_strategy",
      "rationale": "Halve the learning rate across all four datasets to test whether smaller updates improve validation stability. The scheduler's relative decay and minimum-rate ratio remain unchanged, as do the optimizer, model, loss, sampling, early stopping, seeds and epoch limit.",
      "edits": [
        {
          "find": "LR            = float(os.environ.get(\"GRU4REC_LR\", \"1e-3\"))",
